<h1><%= title %></h1>
<p>
  The EJS adapter (<code>@nestvexa/engine-ejs</code>) is installed separately
  from the default Handlebars distribution. One engine instance renders Nest MVC
  pages through Express and Live component templates through
  <code>LiveModule.register({ renderer })</code>.
</p>
<p>
  Templates are trusted application code. Use <code>&lt;%= %&gt;</code> for
  data and keep <code>&lt;%- %&gt;</code> for <code>include()</code> only.
</p>
